@startuml
!include ../../../tools/diagrams/kcna-theme.puml
title An Argo Workflow as a DAG: every box is a Pod

rectangle "checkout\n<size:11>git clone</size>" <<plain>> as a
rectangle "unit-tests" <<good>> as b
rectangle "lint" <<good>> as c
rectangle "security-scan" <<good>> as d
rectangle "build-image\n<size:11>kaniko / buildkit</size>" as e
rectangle "push + update tag\n<size:11>commit to config repo</size>" <<accent>> as f

a --> b
a --> c
a --> d
b --> e
c --> e
d --> e
e --> f

caption <i>unit-tests, lint and security-scan depend only on checkout, so they run IN PARALLEL as three Pods; build-image waits for all three.</i>
@enduml
